<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<text>
<p>ASCOT, England, June 20 - Scoreboard on the second day of</p>
<p>the second test between England and Australia at Lord's on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>England first innings</p>
<p> M.Butcher c Blewett c McGrath	  5</p>
<p> M.Atherton c Taylor b McGrath	  1</p>
<p> A.Stewart b McGrath			1</p>
<p> M.Hussain not out			 10</p>
<p> G.Thorpe not out			  13</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 nb-4)			  8</p>
<p> Total (for three wickets)	     38</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-11 2-12 3-13</p>
<p>To bat: J.Crawley, M.Ealham, R.Croft, D.Gough, A.Caddick,</p>
<p>D.Malcolm</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): McGrath 10-2-21-3, Reiffel</p>
<p>6-4-4-0, Kasprowicz 5-1-9-0</p>
<p>Australia: M.Taylor, M.Elliott, G.Blewett, M.Waugh, S.Waugh,</p>
<p>M.Bevan, I.Healy, S.Warne, P.Reiffel, M.Kasprowicz, G.McGrath</p>
